cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use the code and experiments in this repository, please cite this software project.'
type: software
title: 'Forecast value for storage-based voltage management: code and experiments'
authors:
  - family-names: 'Abdul Halim'
    given-names: 'Elif Gul'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/elifabh/forecast-value-anon'
abstract: >-
  Research scripts and execution logs for comparisons of day-ahead persistence,
  NWP-based solar forecasting, and solar-only perfect foresight in battery
  dispatch for voltage management on distribution feeders.
keywords:
  - solar forecasting
  - energy storage
  - voltage control
  - numerical weather prediction
  - distribution networks
